      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I get this issue a LOT aswell, as someone who uses their chatbox as the primary form of communication.\n\nThese are some things i picked up on:\n\nThis only happens to me after i have already sent a message that is still being displayed above my head. once the message goes away the new one can be sent\n\nusing the \"clear chatbox\" function from the radial menu doesnt allow the new message to be sent, even though the chatbox above my head is now clear\n\nthe typing indicator is still visible when typing, even if the message never gets sent.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
