  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-10-10T02:12:26.431Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I've noticed on occasion my chatbox will become \"unresponsive\" for a short time, maybe 10 seconds?\n\nI can still type as usual, but any message will not send while typing, nor will it appear when I press the Send button.\n\nOnly tested on PC, no idea how to reproduce. In case it's related, I've been using the compact chatbox UI on desktop mode when this has occured.\n\nWhen it happens It seems opening/closing the quick menu fixes the chatbox, but I'll need to do further testing to see if that's actually what fixes it.",
